<title>HONG KONG: Nomura Int'l sets warrants on Tysan.</title>
<headline>Nomura Int'l sets warrants on Tysan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International Plc said it issued one million American style call warrants on foundation piling and property concern Tysan Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>One warrant controls ten shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$0.2095    PREMIUM	 N/A</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$0.4887    GEARING	 N/A</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  15.AUG.97    PAYDATE	 05.SEPT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  5,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    US$0.2327</p>
<p> NOTE		  US$1.00 to HK$7.7342</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
